# Common Mistakes

❌ Bangladesh is famous about rivers.

✅ Bangladesh is famous **for** its rivers.

---

❌ I live at Sylhet.

✅ I live **in** Sylhet.

---

❌ Sylhet have many tea garden.

✅ Sylhet has many beautiful tea gardens.

---

❌ It is very beautiful place.

✅ It is a very beautiful place.

---

# Band 8+ Tip

Avoid giving only a list of facts. Explain **why** your hometown or country is special to you.

### ❌ Basic

> I live in Sylhet.

### ✅ Band 8+

> I live in Sylhet, which is widely known for its breathtaking tea gardens and peaceful surroundings. What I appreciate most is the calm lifestyle and the natural beauty, which provide a refreshing escape from the hustle and bustle of larger cities.

